# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled C++ artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The SA informer's `sa_solver` binary is built locally via
# `cd qReduMIS_package/qReduMIS/solver/informers/classical/sa/_cpp && make`.
# The sources (*.cc, *.h, *.hpp, Makefile) are tracked; the binary is not, so
# no executable is ever released with the library.
sa_solver
*.o
*.obj
*.so
*.dylib
*.a

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependency lock file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# qReduMIS is a library, so it deliberately does not pin a resolved dependency
# set; consumers resolve against their own index. Locks generated behind a
# corporate mirror also embed internal Artifactory URLs, so never commit one.
poetry.lock

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Rydberg and OR-Tools backends dump each iteration's raw shots to
# `result_backend_it<N>.json` in the current working directory, so simply
# running the example notebook or a solve loop litters the tree with them.
# They are per-run data, never source.
result_backend_it*.json

# Output folder created by qReduMIS_package/examples/script.py.
qReduMIS_package/examples/results/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
